OL,3,ARoyal Mail losing 400 postal workers a
OL,4,Aweek, says union
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe union claims the new system is not
OL,7,Fworking in hundreds of offices, and BBC
OL,8,FYour Voice has heard from staff warning
OL,9,Fof a "nightmare" Christmas ahead as the
OL,10,Fnumber of parcels increases.
OL,12,FRoyal Mail says the reforms are part of
OL,13,Fits plan to deliver a more "efficient
OL,14,Fand financially sustainable" service.
